</div></span></div><div class="Intro_projectDetails__UWcsm"><div class="Intro_left__d8bha"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><div><p class="Intro_smallHeading__gYXTn">Industry</p><p>Design Agency</p></div><div><p class="Intro_smallHeading__gYXTn">Location</p><p>London, UK</p></div></span></div><div class="Intro_right__E3UWy"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><div><p class="Intro_smallHeading__gYXTn">Featured by</p><div class="Intro_list__65yay"><a href="https://www.awwwards.com/sites/isi-global-1" target="_blank">Awwwards Honourable Mention</a></div></div></span></div></div><div class="Intro_link__Wrq2r"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><a href="https://www.isiglobal.com/" target="_blank" style="background-color:#000000;border-color:#000000"><span>Visit site</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 12.6 12.6" class="Intro_buttonArrow___9UE0"><path fill="#fff" d="M11.85 12.6c-.41 0-.75-.34-.75-.75V1.5H.75C.34 1.5 0 1.16 0 .75S.34 0 .75 0h11.1c.41 0 .75.34.75.75v11.1c0 .41-.34.75-.75.75z"></path><path fill="#fff" d="M1.13 12.21c-.19 0-.38-.07-.53-.22a.754.754 0 010-1.06L11.32.22c.29-.29.77-.29 1.06 0 .29.29.29.77 0 1.06L1.66 11.99c-.15.15-.34.22-.53.22z"></path></svg></a></span></div></div></section><section class="ContentBuilder_contentBuilder__FAKQG"><section data-margin="default"><div class="container"><div class="SingleImage_containedImage__N2jLD"><section class="Video_video__2erdW"><div class="ImageEnter_image__FSEP_" data-fill="false"><div class="Video_videoContainer__21JKT"><div class="Video_loopVideo__1G4By"><span class="AutoplayVideo_video__zckWy AutoplayVideo_fill__ZPgCR"><video loop="" muted="" playsInline=""></video></span></div></div></div></section></div></div></section><section class="TextLeftListRight_textLeftListRight__i5dfy" data-margin="default" data-right-empty="true" style="--brand-color:red"><div class="container"><div class="TextLeftListRight_left__fjEbB"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><div class="prose"><h3>What we did</h3>
<p>We were tasked with creating an industry-leading website that would excite, inform, and convert clients, while also providing the marketing team with the tools for future growth. The challenge was to improve the user experience, bring their refreshed brand to life, and drive lead generation. Our key goals were to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Optimise the UX with an intuitive structure</li>
<li>Bring the new brand identity to life in the design</li>
<li>Ensure the site was fast, responsive, and seamless across all devices</li>
<li>Provide a flexible, scalable CMS for easy content updates</li>
</ul>
<p>We carried out SEO keyword research and optimisation, considering SEO from the very beginning to inform the sitemap, information architecture (IA), UX, and content strategy. We also set up Google Analytics and Tag Manager to track site performance and ensure continuous improvement.</p>
<p><!-- notionvc: 82b55fa3-3e57-43ad-8fc3-c092de9d3cfc --></p>
</div></span></div></div></section><section class="SingleImage_singleImage__NY3zv" data-margin="default"><div class="ImageEnter_image__FSEP_" data-fill="false"><div class="container"><div class="SingleImage_containedImage__N2jLD"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_fill__EiIzS"><img data-srcset="/__external__/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/02/Colours-1400x788.png 1400w, /__external__/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/02/Colours-2000x1125.png 2000w, /__external__/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/02/Colours-500x281.png 500w, /__external__/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/02/Colours-768x432.png 768w, /__external__/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/02/Colours-1536x864.png 1536w, /__external__/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/02/Colours-2048x1152.png 2048w" data-src="/__external__/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/02/Colours.png" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="1377" width="2448" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></div></div></div></section><section data-margin="default"><div class="container"><div class="SingleImage_containedImage__N2jLD"><section class="Video_video__2erdW"><div class="ImageEnter_image__FSEP_" data-fill="false"><div class="Video_videoContainer__21JKT"><div class="Video_loopVideo__1G4By"><span class="AutoplayVideo_video__zckWy AutoplayVideo_fill__ZPgCR"><video loop="" muted="" playsInline=""></video></span></div></div></div></section></div></div></section><section data-margin="default"><div class="container"><div class="SingleImage_containedImage__N2jLD"><section class="Video_video__2erdW"><div class="ImageEnter_image__FSEP_" data-fill="false"><div class="Video_videoContainer__21JKT"><div class="Video_loopVideo__1G4By"><span class="AutoplayVideo_video__zckWy AutoplayVideo_fill__ZPgCR"><video loop="" muted="" playsInline=""></video></span></div></div></div></section></div></div></section><section class="TextLeftListRight_textLeftListRight__i5dfy" data-margin="default" data-right-empty="false" style="--brand-color:red"><div class="container"><div class="TextLeftListRight_left__fjEbB"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><div class="prose"><h3>Design and build</h3>
<p>For the website design, we went with a black-and-white base to keep it clean, modern, and professional, incorporating playful pops of ISI Global’s new yellow accent colour ‘Volt’ where it counted to highlight key sections and adding visual interest. The clever mix of serif and sans serif fonts strikes the perfect balance between maturity and creativity, while section copy that appears as you scroll invites engagement and draws you deeper into the content. It’s design that’s not only visually striking but designed to keep users hooked.</p>
<p>We introduced <strong>‘Pathed’ Graphics</strong> inspired by ISI Global’s refreshed logo, symbolising the customer journey and reflecting their end-to-end retail design services. These graphics play an important role in visually guiding visitors through the site, providing a clear and engaging path that complements the content.</p>
